secubox-annuaire (0.1.1-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * security: enforce self-certifying authorship at read time (an Identity
    entry only sets state for its own did:author); authorize revocation (only
    self or the grafting inviter), derive REVOKED from the signed
    RevocationNotice (no victim-identity forging); staged single-step
    emancipation with a required founder_did. +7 adversarial tests.

